msgstr "%s의 프로필이 제거됩니다. 이 작업은 되돌릴 수 없습니다."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profile_wizard.rs:335 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profile_wizard.rs:388 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:667 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:746 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:754
